<mxCell id="rkm3_subtitle" value="DS 拥有知识索引；Navia 拥有治理与 ID 映射｜不访问 DS 内部 workspace｜远程 HTTP 不持有本地 root IO 锁" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontFamily=Arial;spacing=4;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="68" width="1520" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_legend" value="绿：当前代码存在（验收另标）　橙：需修改/复验　蓝：待新增　灰：外部/范围外　红：门禁/风险　所有“待新增”仅为文档设计" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontFamily=Arial;spacing=4;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="119" width="1520" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_l1" value="E03/E08 → E11 保存&#xa;&#xa;用户保存 / 显式导入&#xa;校验 workspace / root / 云处理同意&#xa;内容 raw-byte SHA-256&#xa;sourceId 与 sampleId 分开&#xa;相同幂等 key 不产生第二来源" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#fff0ce;strokeColor=#66716c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="180" width="460" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_l2" value="E12 KnowledgeGovernanceStore&#xa;&#xa;root 锁内校验并写待提交 outbox&#xa;持久授权集合 / source revision&#xa;文件、云、记忆、策略分别校验&#xa;提交前再验 generation 与同意&#xa;本地事务 ≠ 远程原子事务" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#e3f0fc;strokeColor=#66716c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="180" width="460" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_l3" value="E10 → E17/E18 真实构建&#xa;&#xa;HTTP import → build/start → operation&#xa;DS 公共 API / 稳定 backendSourceId&#xa;queued → ingesting → building&#xa;trace_ready 或 degraded/failed&#xa;未知提交结果 → 对账，不换 key 重发" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#eeedf0;strokeColor=#66716c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="180" width="460" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_l4" value="E11/E12 重启重读&#xa;&#xa;Runtime / DS 重启后重新认证&#xa;source / revision / hash / 映射持久&#xa;PermissionRoot fd/epoch 不持久&#xa;旧 operation 不承诺自动恢复&#xa;未知对账结果不能伪 succeeded" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#e3f0fc;strokeColor=#66716c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="430" width="460" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_l5" value="E17/E19 query 与 dispatch&#xa;&#xa;检索前过滤获准 source/revision&#xa;模型发送前再验 purpose/generation&#xa;未获准与隔离内容不进入上下文&#xa;真实provider/model/span可核查&#xa;默认 DS fallback 不算 RAG 成功" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#eeedf0;strokeColor=#66716c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="430" width="460" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_l6" value="E14/E12 → E17/E19 归档与隔离&#xa;&#xa;retentionState 独立于 buildStatus&#xa;archive 可检索但标注归档&#xa;quarantine 在 DS 检索/发送前排除&#xa;管理页显式查看/恢复，不自动外发&#xa;不设隔离到期自动永久删除" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#e3f0fc;strokeColor=#66716c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="430" width="460" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_l7" value="E06/E11 用户永久 Forget&#xa;&#xa;输入 forget 二次确认&#xa;持久 tombstone → 禁止读取/生成&#xa;DS 清除快照及派生贡献&#xa;保留其余 supportingSourceIds&#xa;原始聊天/宿主原件不在删除范围" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#fff0ce;strokeColor=#66716c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="680" width="460" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_l8" value="E17/E18 防复活与验证&#xa;&#xa;四面重读 Library / Ask / Graph / Trace&#xa;同源 direct/reload/Back/reopen 均拒绝&#xa;重启 / 旧任务提交不复活&#xa;部分删除、坏响应或残留 → failed/degraded&#xa;removed 标记本身不能等于 verified" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#eeedf0;strokeColor=#66716c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="680" width="460" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_l9" value="S02/S09 出门断言&#xa;&#xa;24源至少20真实完整构建&#xa;三个来源完整 Forget 观察链&#xa;跨重启稳定 ID/hash&#xa;未知提交不重复、旧任务不回写&#xa;若 DS 公共接口无法支持则停止" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#fce6e6;strokeColor=#66716c;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="680" width="460" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_edge0" value="入账" edge="1" parent="1" source="rkm3_l1" target="rkm3_l2" style="exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#526563;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;"><mxGeometry relative="1" y="-5" as="geometry"><Array as="points"></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_edge1" value="出站" edge="1" parent="1" source="rkm3_l2" target="rkm3_l3" style="exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#526563;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;"><mxGeometry relative="1" y="-5" as="geometry"><Array as="points"></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_edge2" value="证据" edge="1" parent="1" source="rkm3_l3" target="rkm3_l5" style="exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#526563;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;"><mxGeometry relative="1" y="-5" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1330" y="407.5"/><mxPoint x="800" y="407.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_edge3" value="重新取数" edge="1" parent="1" source="rkm3_l4" target="rkm3_l5" style="exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#526563;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;"><mxGeometry relative="1" y="-5" as="geometry"><Array as="points"></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_edge4" value="人工确认" edge="1" parent="1" source="rkm3_l6" target="rkm3_l7" style="exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#526563;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;"><mxGeometry relative="1" y="-5" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1330" y="657.5"/><mxPoint x="270" y="657.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="rkm3_edge5" value="真实级联" edge="1" parent="1" source="rkm3_l7" target="rkm3_l8" style="exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#526563;fontSize=13;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;"><mxGeometry relative="1" y="-5" as="geometry"><Array as="points"></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
